      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "PERFECT FEELING (8) finished tenth last start over 1660m at Albion Park, beaten 60 metres, after a good third at this track the run prior. Finds a nice race and can bounce straight back. JILLIBY PANDA (6) was responsible for a far better performance at his latest appearance when he scored by 5.5 metres over 1850m at Marburg. Leading hope in a similar race. ROCKNROLL DA GAMA (7) was out of the money two runs ago then broke and finished eighth last start over 1780m at this track, coming home 19 metres from the winner. Can travel in a nice spot from this draw and wait on the sprint lane if necessary. This doesn't look as hard so he is capable of turning things around. TAKE COURAGE (5) is the best of the rest after finishing fourth over 1780m at this track last time out.",
